        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T01:02:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it necessary that users are able to extend these with their own methods? If not, then a more controlled interface would be to let RegisterSdkMemberTrait take the property name as a string and return an SdkMemberTrait. That would ensure there aren\u0027t any created that don\u0027t get registered, and it\u0027d also reduce the boilerplate both here and in user code.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 414,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 414,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "f491d40d0617b3e06a4ac70a259d9481bcbf20c2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b4f4c2d_04de1016",
        "filename": "android/sdk.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 414,
      "author": {
        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T14:36:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know, but I think it may be helpful. Experience with SdkMemberType shows that there are two reasons why the type needs to be extensible.\n1) When adding functionality to the sdk update mechanism, e.g. IsHostOsDependent().\n2) In order to embed client side behavior into the struct, e.g. librarySdkMemberType.linkTypes.\n\nI cannot think of any change to sdk update mechanism which would require changes to this type but I think that there might be some benefits to embedding client side behavior into the struct, e.g. for handling different image types.\n\nWe could add a helper func, e.g. RegisterBasicSdkMemberTrait(propertyName string)  SdkMemberTrait {..} to remove the need for boilerplate while keeping the ability to extend if it becomes needed.",
      "parentUuid": "ac0fbef9_4f4e0580",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 414,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 414,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "f491d40d0617b3e06a4ac70a259d9481bcbf20c2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
