      "author": {
        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T14:36:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It could but the current implementation is simply a map and I don\u0027t want code that uses this to treat this as a map just in case it needs to be changed. So, the reason for using the interface is not to allow multiple implementations but just to insulate code that uses it from the implementation.",
      "parentUuid": "bbb9614d_0af2a4ac",
